<title>USA: NYSE Unavailables-AMP, International Rectifier Rykoff-Sexton and Corimon SACA.</title>
<headline>NYSE Unavailables-AMP, International Rectifier Rykoff-Sexton and Corimon SACA.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said on Thursday that AMP Inc, International Rectifier Corp and Rykoff-Sexton Inc were unavailable for news.</p>
<p>Corimon SACA also was unavailable for after-hours trading, the NYSE said.</p>
</text>
